      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Analytics are important and need more data:\n\nWe need to know:\n\n- Durations: How long are people staying? are they joining and leaving?\n\n- Heatmaps: Where are they hanging out? Are they standing at spawn or can they find the social areas, which social areas are underperforming?\n\n- Player counts: Is the world at capacity most of the time, should I add or less player slots for best fit\n\n- Performance and Hardware: Are quest players getting lower frames, do they need more tuning, are certain brands of GPUs having issues, is desktop performance worse than VR?\n\n- - Do android users have more RAM than I thought, do they need a battery saving setting for the world?\n\n- - Is my world the issue or avatars the performance bottleneck?\n\n- World Visiters: Is a majority of my playtime repeat guests or 1 time visitors\n\n- - Is it easy for visitors to stay longer, is there player retention issues by player experience or rank\n\n- Location: Is a majority of my visitors from Japan or Mexico? \n\n- - Should I spend time to add multilingual options?\n\n- Time Zones: are players visiting my maps during the weekdays or do they only get on for \"drinking\" nights on weekends? What are the peak times to do a multi-instance event?\n\n- Player Feedback: Did the players like or dislike, what was their total time at review",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
