      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like more accurate demographic info:\n\n- Age\n\n- Nationality\n\n- Rank (are more new players joining, or more trusted users?)\n\nIf I find something surprising, like an uptick in users from Canada and France, that may promote the need for a French translation that I can't currently see right now. When I ask about ages on group tours, they tend to be much older (30+). It'd be good to have that broken down in a line graph somehow, to see where they rise, where they peak, where they fall off.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
